cloud-architecture-diagram

direction down
colorMode pastel
styleMode plain
typeface clean

BackendAgent [label: "Backend main_agent tool registry", icon: brain, color: purple]

McpRuntime [label: "External MCP service runtime", color: green] {
  UvicornApp [label: "uvicorn ASGI app", icon: server, color: green]
  FastMcpServer [label: "FastMCP Streamable HTTP", icon: plug, color: green]
  ToolRegistration [label: "registered MCP tools", icon: list-checks, color: green]
  Settings [label: "pydantic settings and Infisical env", icon: key-round, color: gray]
  StructuredLogs [label: "masked structured logs", icon: scroll-text, color: gray]
}

McpTools [label: "MCP tool facade", color: "#0f766e"] {
  NaverSearchTool [label: "naver.search", icon: search, color: "#0f766e"]
  WebSearchTool [label: "web.search", icon: globe, color: "#0f766e"]
  TmapPoiTool [label: "tmap.search_poi", icon: map-pin, color: "#0f766e"]
  TmapRouteTool [label: "tmap.route_pedestrian", icon: route, color: "#0f766e"]
}

ProviderAdapters [label: "Provider adapters and normalization", color: "#2563eb"] {
  NaverAdapter [label: "Naver result normalizer", icon: file-json, color: "#2563eb"]
  FirecrawlAdapter [label: "Firecrawl result normalizer", icon: file-json, color: "#2563eb"]
  TmapAdapter [label: "TMAP POI and route normalizer", icon: file-json, color: "#2563eb"]
  SafetyHelpers [label: "limit bounds, secret read, warning results", icon: shield-check, color: "#2563eb"]
}

ExternalProviders [label: "External APIs", color: orange] {
  NaverApi [label: "Naver Search API", icon: search, color: orange]
  FirecrawlApi [label: "Firecrawl Search API", icon: globe, color: orange]
  TmapApi [label: "TMAP POI and route APIs", icon: map, color: orange]
  NaverMapLinks [label: "Naver Map web links", icon: map-pinned, color: orange]
}

BackendAgent > FastMcpServer: streamable HTTP MCP
UvicornApp > FastMcpServer: create ASGI app
FastMcpServer > ToolRegistration: expose tools
Settings > FastMcpServer: host, port, path
ToolRegistration > NaverSearchTool: register
ToolRegistration > WebSearchTool: register
ToolRegistration > TmapPoiTool: register
ToolRegistration > TmapRouteTool: register
NaverSearchTool > NaverAdapter: search_naver
WebSearchTool > FirecrawlAdapter: search_firecrawl
TmapPoiTool > TmapAdapter: search_tmap_poi
TmapRouteTool > TmapAdapter: route_tmap_pedestrian
NaverAdapter > SafetyHelpers: credentials, limit, failure shape
FirecrawlAdapter > SafetyHelpers: credentials, filters, failure shape
TmapAdapter > SafetyHelpers: credentials, limit, failure shape
NaverAdapter > NaverApi: HTTP GET
FirecrawlAdapter > FirecrawlApi: HTTP POST
TmapAdapter > TmapApi: HTTP GET or POST
TmapAdapter > NaverMapLinks: place and route URLs
ToolRegistration > StructuredLogs: invocation summary

legend [position: bottom-left] {
  [color: purple, label: "Backend caller"]
  [color: green, label: "MCP runtime"]
  [color: "#0f766e", label: "Tool facade"]
  [color: "#2563eb", label: "Adapter and normalization"]
  [color: orange, label: "External provider"]
  [color: gray, label: "Config and observability"]
}
